# The performance FX: roll (it speeds up while held), pump (a sidechain on the synths, in time), riser (a build:
# a rising high-pass and wash), vinyl (dust and hiss, faded in). Keys: G#4 roll, A#4 pump, C#5 riser, D#5 vinyl.
# fxperf.wav has each in its own stretch for listening: 4 s roll (4 s), 9 s pump (4 s), 14 s riser (5 s), 20 s vinyl (4 s)
wait 4000
wav fxperf.wav
tap FX
wait 100
key 15 down
wait 4000
expect fxmask 4194304
key 15 up
wait 1000
key 17 down
wait 4000
expect fxmask 8388608
key 17 up
wait 1000
key 20 down
wait 5000
expect fxmask 16777216
shot fxperf_riser.png
key 20 up
wait 1000
key 22 down
wait 4000
expect fxmask 33554432
key 22 up
wait 1000
tap FX
wavstop
